216
00:21:42,180 --> 00:21:50,580
[EN*]  sometimes we don't even realize we're repeating the same unhealthy pattern

217
00:21:51,860 --> 00:21:58,900
[EN*]  we react the same way we think the same thoughts make the same decisions then we wonder why life

218
00:21:58,900 --> 00:22:05,780
[EN*]  feels stuck well therapy shines a light on those patterns but insight alone is not enough imagine

219
00:22:05,780 --> 00:22:09,540
