261
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:20,280
[EN]  When I look back over the thousands of therapy sessions, I don't remember clients changing overnight, I remember people changing gradually, one new habit, one new conversation, one new insight.

262
00:27:20,280 --> 00:27:46,280
[EN]  One courageous decision at a time. That is usually how transformation happens. Not all at once, but one faithful step after a moment.

263
00:27:46,280 --> 00:27:49,660
[EN*]  So far today, we've talked about what therapy is.

264
00:27:49,800 --> 00:27:51,620
