273
00:28:14,240 --> 00:28:30,660
[EN]  Those questions certainly have value. Training does matter, experience matters, specialized knowledge matters, but after many years in this profession, I don't believe those are the first questions people should ask. Instead, I would encourage you to ask three questions.

274
00:28:50,660 --> 00:28:57,120
[ZH] 但是我覺得其實可以用三個核心問題來檢視

275
00:28:57,120 --> 00:29:02,260
[ZH] 問一問,我可以相信這個人嗎?

276
00:29:04,920 --> 00:29:10,800
[EN]  predictors of successful therapy is something called the therapeutic alliance. That simply

277
00:29:10,800 --> 00:29:15,480
[EN]  means the quality of the relationship between the therapist and the client? Do you feel

278
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:21,380
[EN]  heard? Respected? Do you believe this person generally wants to help you? Can you imagine

279
00:29:21,380 --> 00:29:26,660
